  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase-out process - SE/SA bilateral cooperation should be completed by end June 2014. Since Jan 2014 there are 3 staff (Head Dev Coop. &amp; 2 NPOs) responsible to follow-up final reporting, etc.  Already, similar events were hosted by the Embassy for SA partners and this final activity is now planned for Embassy staff who in one way or the other contributed during the application of PDC Strategy.</narrative>
